@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

participant WeatherApiService
participant HomeFragment
participant AlertViewModel
participant NotificationManagerCompat
actor Utente

== Rilevamento Condizione Allerta ==

WeatherApiService -> HomeFragment : onResponse(OpenMeteoResponse)
HomeFragment -> HomeFragment : Analizza dati (es. velocità vento, UV, Temp)

alt Condizione di allerta rilevata (es. Vento > 30km/h)
    HomeFragment -> AlertViewModel : isAlertAlreadyNotified(newAlert)
    AlertViewModel --> HomeFragment : false (non ancora notificata)
    
    HomeFragment -> AlertViewModel : addWindAlert(newAlert)
    
    == Invio Notifica ==
    
    HomeFragment -> NotificationManagerCompat : notify(WIND_NOTIFICATION_ID, builder.build())
    NotificationManagerCompat -> Utente : Visualizza notifica push su dispositivo
    
    == Interazione ==
    
    Utente -> NotificationManagerCompat : Clicca sulla notifica
    NotificationManagerCompat -> HomeFragment : Apre l'app (MainActivity/Home)
end

@enduml